          </p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Granite & Dense Stone</h3>
          <p>
            Granite is dense and far less porous, so it needs less product but still benefits from sealing on countertops where oil is a threat. A fabricator-grade impregnator like Tenax Proseal is built for exactly this high-use, dense-stone job.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Flagstone & Paving Stone</h3>
